                Government =    $1100   $675
                Academic =      $1000   $600
                Includes continental breakfast, p.m. snack, and course materials

Hours:          8:30am-5:00pm
                (Continental Breakfast: 8:00-8:30 daily)

Register:       - Call Kim Kelly at: 800-569-0123 x278
                - Email: kkelly at splus.mathsoft.com
                - Web: http://www.splus.com/train/train_registration.html

Prerequisites: A basic knowledge of the language of data analysis and of
elementary statistics will be assumed. Some familiarity with S-PLUS
Fundamentals could be helpful, though not necessary. This course is meant to
introduce models and show how S-PLUS can be used to fit and analyze them.

For a more detailed course description, location information, and other
courses, please visit: http://www.splus.com/train/schedule.html

