Hello Again,

Wow, within 10 -15 minutes, the problem is resolved via the invisible()
function.  Thanks go to Ripley, Zaslavsky, McKinney, Malthouse, Homiak,Li,
Jagger, and anyone else I didn't thank in time.

The pseudo code with the print-screen suppressant would look like:

 if (condition) {
    invisible(df <- df2)
 }

or

 if (condition) {
    df <- df2
    invisible()
 }

Thanks again!

 - Paul

