There is in library MASS:

Find Maximum Position in Matrix

DESCRIPTION:
       Find the maximum  position  for  each  row  of  a  matrix,
       breaking ties at random.

USAGE:
       max.col(A)

REQUIRED ARGUMENTS:
A:     a matrix

VALUE:
       index of a maximal value for each row.

which is as simple to use as anything I have seen, as in
A[cbind(1:nrow(A), max.col(A))].

