4   2.5364015 -0.58616561
5  -0.2616264  0.02969666

Degrees of freedom: 20 total; 10 residual
Residual standard error: 1.027949
> 

It works as expected.

Just a warning to be careful!

Any idea why this works this way?  This doesn't seem logical.

